{"about_the_game":"<p>Wrap your way to bliss in Zen Bound 2, the unique down-tempo indie game! This is a different gaming experience: an opportunity to slow down, zone out and focus on a task that\u2019s challenging but not stressful, a set of gentle puzzles for the mind and fingers to solve.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The goal of the game is to paint wooden sculptures by wrapping them in rope - a task that may sound simple but has surprising complexity. Each of the levels presents a spatial puzzle that becomes obvious through inspection. Some levels feature paint bombs that are helpful in covering complex areas of the object.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Zen Bound 2 is a calm and meditative gameplay experience, with tactile, dusty visuals and a sublime, enveloping soundtrack by the sensational electronic artist \u2018Ghost Monkey\u2019.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Key features:</h2><ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Multi-touch controls for object manipulation on Macs with multi-touch trackpads\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Over 100 levels\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Multiple gameplay modes with paint bombs\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>45-minute soundtrack from \u2018Ghost Monkey\u2019\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Beautiful high definition visuals</ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting the Hang of It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/61600/374308c9a27136558274b5d82a661d5af389abd4.jpg"},{"name":"Flower Garden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/61600/1327e661299d890c5ad2e6f8cabc2fcc5f2e3a7f.jpg"},{"name":"Unwinder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/61600/f93cbd9466149a3e61c70f01e99eaa16f3c636f6.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/61600/809c0db837b3d97772ccb1c6b51fa3955ce03f01.jpg"},{"name":"Gordian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/61600/f136b1e3843b2dc6ee2fe3d8394a94ed2fc59de0.jpg"},{"name":"Tied t